# project: nightly-pipeline
VAR retry_count = 0
VAR audited = false
VAR freshness_sla = 24

-> ingest

=== ingest ===
Pull the nightly dumps from the vendor SFTP drop.
* [Dump retrieved] -> transform
+ [Vendor outage, retry tomorrow night] ~loop~ -> ingest

=== transform ===
Normalize the dumps into the warehouse schema; mapping bugs surface here.
~ retry_count += 1
* [Mapping bugs found] ~loop~ -> reconcile

=== reconcile ===
Reconcile row counts against the source and patch the mapping.
+ [Patched, run the transform again] -> transform

=== publish ===
Publish the curated tables and notify downstream consumers.
~ audited = true
* {audited} [Audit trail written] -> END
